---
layout: layouts/base.njk
permalink: "/webinars/"
title: "Federal Retirement Webinars with Ann Werts | Capital Wealth"
description: "Free live federal retirement webinars with benefits specialist Ann Werts — FERS pension, TSP strategy, FEHB & Medicare, Social Security, VERA/VSIP/RIF, and more. A new session every other Thursday. Register for the next one or watch past replays."
ogImage: "/assets/images/photos/federal/american-flag-hero.jpg"
ogImageAlt: "Capital Wealth federal retirement webinar series with Ann Werts"
faqSchema:
  - question: "How much do the webinars cost?"
    answer: "Nothing. Every session in the series is free and held live online via Zoom, with open Q&A at the end."
  - question: "How often are the webinars?"
    answer: "A new session runs every other Thursday, 5:00-6:00 PM Mountain. Each one covers a different federal retirement topic, so you can attend just the ones you need or follow the whole series."
  - question: "Do I have to be close to retirement to attend?"
    answer: "No. The series is designed for federal employees at any stage. The earlier you understand your benefits and your numbers, the more options you have - so it is worth attending well before you plan to retire."
  - question: "Will I be sold financial products on the webinar?"
    answer: "No. These are educational sessions with no high-pressure pitch. Ann teaches the material and answers your questions; if you want a personal review afterward, you can request one, but it is never required."
  - question: "Can I watch past webinars I missed?"
    answer: "Yes. Recorded sessions are posted on this page as replays you can watch any time."
  - question: "Can my spouse attend with me?"
    answer: "Absolutely - spouses are welcome and encouraged. You can watch together from one device or each register for your own link."
---

<style>
  .wb {
    --cw-navy:   #0f2742;
    --cw-navy-2: #0a1d33;
    --cw-gold:   #fdd25e;
    --cw-gray:   #f8fafc;
    --cw-ink:    #0F1A2A;
    --cw-slate:  #5a6675;
    --cw-line:   #e4e8ee;
    --fed-red:   #B31942;
    --fed-blue:  #0A3161;
    font-family: var(--font-family, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Helvetica Neue", Arial, sans-serif);
    color: var(--cw-ink);
  }
  .wb * { box-sizing: border-box; }
  .wb-wrap { max-width: 1140px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 1.5rem; }

  /* ---- Hero ---- */
  .wb-hero {
    background:
      linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(15,39,66,0.92), rgba(10,29,51,0.96)),
      url("/assets/images/photos/federal/american-flag-hero.jpg") center/cover no-repeat;
    color: #fff;
    padding: 5rem 0 4.25rem;
    position: relative;
  }
  .wb-hero::after {
    content: ""; position: absolute; left: 0; right: 0; bottom: 0; height: 4px;
    background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--fed-red) 0 33.3%, #fff 33.3% 66.6%, var(--fed-blue) 66.6% 100%);
  }
  .wb-eyebrow {
    display: inline-block; font-size: .78rem; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: .14em;
    text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--cw-gold); margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }
  .wb-hero h1 {
    font-size: clamp(2.1rem, 5vw, 3.4rem); line-height: 1.08; font-weight: 800;
    margin: 0 0 1rem; letter-spacing: -0.02em; color: #fff;
  }
  .wb-hero h1 em { color: var(--cw-gold); font-style: italic; }
  .wb-hero .lede { font-size: 1.18rem; line-height: 1.55; max-width: 44rem; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.86); margin: 0 0 1.25rem; }
  .wb-presenter { font-size: .98rem; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.7); margin: 0 0 1.85rem; }
  .wb-presenter strong { color: #fff; }
  .wb-cta-row { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: .85rem; }

  .wb-btn {
    display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: .5rem; font-weight: 700; font-size: 1rem;
    padding: .95rem 1.6rem; border-radius: 10px; text-decoration: none; transition: transform .12s ease, box-shadow .12s ease;
  }
  .wb-btn-gold { background: var(--cw-gold); color: var(--cw-navy); text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: .03em; }
  .wb-btn-gold:hover { transform: translateY(-2px); box-shadow: 0 10px 24px rgba(253,210,94,0.3); }
  .wb-btn-ghost { background: transparent; color: #fff; border: 1.5px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.4); }
  .wb-btn-ghost:hover { border-color: #fff; }

  /* ---- Featured "next" band ---- */
  .wb-next { background: var(--cw-gray); padding: 3.25rem 0; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--cw-line); }
  .wb-next-card {
    background: #fff; border: 1px solid var(--cw-line); border-radius: 16px;
    box-shadow: 0 18px 50px rgba(15,39,66,0.08); overflow: hidden;
    display: grid; grid-template-columns: 150px 1fr auto; align-items: center; gap: 1.75rem; padding: 1.9rem 2rem;
  }
  .wb-datechip {
    width: 118px; height: 118px; border-radius: 14px; background: var(--cw-navy); color: #fff;
    display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; justify-content: center; flex: none;
  }
  .wb-datechip .m { font-size: .9rem; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: .12em; color: var(--cw-gold); }
  .wb-datechip .d { font-size: 2.9rem; font-weight: 800; line-height: 1; }
  .wb-datechip .y { font-size: .72rem; letter-spacing: .1em; opacity: .65; margin-top: .15rem; }
  .wb-next-body .badge {
    display: inline-block; font-size: .7rem; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: .1em; text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--fed-red); margin-bottom: .55rem;
  }
  .wb-next-body h2 { font-size: 1.7rem; font-weight: 800; margin: 0 0 .55rem; letter-spacing: -0.01em; color: var(--cw-navy); }
  .wb-next-body p { color: var(--cw-slate); line-height: 1.55; margin: 0 0 .6rem; max-width: 40rem; }
  .wb-next-body .when { font-size: .92rem; font-weight: 600; color: var(--cw-navy); }
  .wb-next-act { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: .55rem; text-align: center; }
  .wb-next-act .ics { font-size: .82rem; color: var(--cw-slate); text-decoration: none; }
  .wb-next-act .ics:hover { color: var(--cw-navy); text-decoration: underline; }

  /* ---- Section scaffolding ---- */
  .wb-section { padding: 3.75rem 0; }
  .wb-section h2.title { font-size: clamp(1.7rem, 3.5vw, 2.3rem); font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: -0.02em; margin: 0 0 .5rem; text-align: center; color: var(--cw-navy); }
  .wb-section .sub { text-align: center; color: var(--cw-slate); max-width: 38rem; margin: 0 auto 2.5rem; line-height: 1.55; }
  .wb-section .sub em { font-style: italic; }

  /* ---- Series grid ---- */
  .wb-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 1.25rem; }
  .wb-card {
    background: #fff; border: 1px solid var(--cw-line); border-radius: 14px; padding: 1.4rem 1.4rem 1.5rem;
    display: flex; flex-direction: column; transition: box-shadow .15s ease, transform .15s ease;
  }
  .wb-card:hover { box-shadow: 0 14px 36px rgba(15,39,66,0.09); transform: translateY(-2px); }
  .wb-card .top { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; margin-bottom: .9rem; }
  .wb-card .mini {
    display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
    width: 58px; height: 58px; border-radius: 10px; background: var(--cw-gray); border: 1px solid var(--cw-line); flex: none;
  }
  .wb-card .mini .m { font-size: .64rem; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: .08em; color: var(--fed-red); }
  .wb-card .mini .d { font-size: 1.45rem; font-weight: 800; line-height: 1; color: var(--cw-navy); }
  .wb-card .tag {
    font-size: .68rem; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: .08em; text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--cw-slate); background: var(--cw-gray); border: 1px solid var(--cw-line);
    padding: .3rem .6rem; border-radius: 999px;
  }
  .wb-card h3 { font-size: 1.12rem; font-weight: 700; margin: 0 0 .5rem; line-height: 1.3; color: var(--cw-ink); }
  .wb-card p { font-size: .9rem; color: var(--cw-slate); line-height: 1.5; margin: 0 0 1.1rem; flex: 1; }
  .wb-card .act { margin-top: auto; }
  .wb-link {
    font-weight: 700; font-size: .9rem; text-decoration: none; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: .35rem;
  }
  .wb-link.register { color: var(--fed-red); }
  .wb-link.replay { color: var(--cw-navy); }
  .wb-link:hover { text-decoration: underline; }
  .wb-soon { font-size: .85rem; font-weight: 600; color: var(--cw-slate); }
  .wb-statusdot {
    display: inline-block; font-size: .66rem; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: .08em; text-transform: uppercase;
    padding: .28rem .55rem; border-radius: 999px;
  }
  .wb-statusdot.next { background: var(--fed-red); color: #fff; }
  .wb-statusdot.past { background: #e9eef4; color: var(--cw-navy); }
  .wb-statusdot.scheduled { background: #fff7e0; color: #8a6a12; border: 1px solid #f3e3b5; }

  /* ---- Replays ---- */
  .wb-replays { background: var(--cw-navy); color: #fff; }
  .wb-replays h2.title, .wb-replays .sub { color: #fff; }
  .wb-replays .sub { color: rgba(255,255,255,0.72); }
  .wb-replay-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 1.5rem; }
  .wb-replay {
    background: rgba(255,255,255,0.04); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.12); border-radius: 14px; overflow: hidden;
    text-decoration: none; color: #fff; display: flex; flex-direction: column; transition: border-color .15s ease, transform .15s ease;
  }
  .wb-replay:hover { border-color: var(--cw-gold); transform: translateY(-2px); }
  .wb-thumb { position: relative; aspect-ratio: 16/9; background: #000; overflow: hidden; }
  .wb-thumb img { width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; display: block; opacity: .9; }
  .wb-play {
    position: absolute; inset: 0; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
  }
  .wb-play span {
    width: 56px; height: 56px; border-radius: 50%; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.92);
    display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
  }
  .wb-play span::before { content: ""; border-left: 16px solid var(--fed-red); border-top: 10px solid transparent; border-bottom: 10px solid transparent; margin-left: 4px; }
  .wb-replay .meta { padding: 1.1rem 1.25rem 1.3rem; }
  .wb-replay .meta .tag { font-size: .68rem; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: .08em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--cw-gold); }
  .wb-replay .meta h3 { font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin: .35rem 0 .4rem; color: #fff; }
  .wb-replay .meta p { font-size: .85rem; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.66); line-height: 1.5; margin: 0; }
  .wb-replay .meta .watch { display: inline-block; margin-top: .85rem; font-weight: 700; font-size: .88rem; color: var(--cw-gold); }

  /* ---- What to expect ---- */
  .wb-points { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr); gap: 1.25rem; }
  .wb-point { text-align: center; padding: 1.25rem .75rem; }
  .wb-point .ic { font-size: 1.6rem; margin-bottom: .5rem; }
  .wb-point h4 { font-size: 1rem; font-weight: 700; margin: 0 0 .3rem; color: var(--cw-ink); }
  .wb-point p { font-size: .86rem; color: var(--cw-slate); line-height: 1.45; margin: 0; }

  /* ---- FAQ ---- */
  .wb-faq { max-width: 760px; margin: 0 auto; }
  .wb-faq details { border-bottom: 1px solid var(--cw-line); padding: 1.1rem 0; }
  .wb-faq summary { font-weight: 700; font-size: 1.02rem; cursor: pointer; list-style: none; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; }
  .wb-faq summary::-webkit-details-marker { display: none; }
  .wb-faq summary::after { content: "+"; font-size: 1.4rem; font-weight: 400; color: var(--cw-slate); }
  .wb-faq details[open] summary::after { content: "\2013"; }
  .wb-faq p { color: var(--cw-slate); line-height: 1.6; margin: .85rem 0 0; }

  /* ---- Soft CTA ---- */
  .wb-soft { background: var(--cw-gray); padding: 3.5rem 0; text-align: center; }
  .wb-soft h2 { font-size: clamp(1.6rem, 3vw, 2.1rem); font-weight: 800; margin: 0 0 .65rem; letter-spacing: -0.01em; color: var(--cw-navy); }
  .wb-soft p { color: var(--cw-slate); max-width: 36rem; margin: 0 auto 1.6rem; line-height: 1.55; }

  /* ---- Compliance ---- */
  .wb-compliance { padding: 2.5rem 0; font-size: .76rem; color: #8a929c; line-height: 1.6; }
  .wb-compliance .wb-wrap { max-width: 900px; }

  @media (max-width: 880px) {
    .wb-grid, .wb-replay-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; }
    .wb-points { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; }
    .wb-next-card { grid-template-columns: 1fr; text-align: center; gap: 1.25rem; }
    .wb-datechip { margin: 0 auto; }
    .wb-next-body p { margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; }
  }
  @media (max-width: 560px) {
    .wb-grid, .wb-replay-grid, .wb-points { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .wb-cta-row { flex-direction: column; }
    .wb-btn { justify-content: center; }
  }
</style>

<div class="wb">

  <!-- ===== HERO ===== -->
  <section class="wb-hero">
    <div class="wb-wrap">
      <span class="wb-eyebrow">Free Live Webinar Series</span>
      <h1>Federal retirement, <em>decoded.</em></h1>
      <p class="lede">A free live webinar every other Thursday with federal benefits specialist Ann Werts — FERS, TSP, FEHB &amp; Medicare, Social Security, survivor benefits, and the early-out offers landing on desks right now. Bring your questions; we save time for open Q&amp;A.</p>
      <p class="wb-presenter">Hosted by <strong>{{ webinars.series.presenter }}</strong> — {{ webinars.series.presenterTitle }}</p>
      <div class="wb-cta-row">
        <a href="{{ webinars.series.registerUrl }}" class="wb-btn wb-btn-gold" data-cta="hero-register">Register for the next webinar</a>
        <a href="#replays" class="wb-btn wb-btn-ghost">Watch past replays</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ===== NEXT (featured) ===== -->
  {% for ep in webinars.episodes %}{% if ep.status == "next" %}
  <section class="wb-next" id="next">
    <div class="wb-wrap">
      <div class="wb-next-card">
        <div class="wb-datechip">
          <span class="m">{{ ep.mon }}</span>
          <span class="d">{{ ep.day }}</span>
          <span class="y">2026</span>
        </div>
        <div class="wb-next-body">
          <span class="badge">★ Next Webinar — Register Now</span>
          <h2>{{ ep.title }}</h2>
          <p>{{ ep.blurb }}</p>
          <p class="when">{{ ep.dateDisplay }} · {{ ep.timeMt }} · Live on Zoom</p>
        </div>
        <div class="wb-next-act">
          <a href="{{ ep.registerUrl }}" class="wb-btn wb-btn-gold" data-cta="next-register">Reserve your seat →</a>
          {% if ep.icsUrl %}<a href="{{ ep.icsUrl }}" class="ics">+ Add to calendar</a>{% endif %}
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
  {% endif %}{% endfor %}

  <!-- ===== FULL SERIES ===== -->
  <section class="wb-section" id="series">
    <div class="wb-wrap">
      <h2 class="title">The full series</h2>
      <p class="sub">Twelve sessions covering every major federal retirement decision. Attend the ones you need, or follow the whole series. <em>{{ webinars.series.datesDisclaimer }}</em></p>
      <div class="wb-grid">
        {% for ep in webinars.episodes %}
        <article class="wb-card">
          <div class="top">
            <div class="mini">
              <span class="m">{{ ep.mon }}</span>
              <span class="d">{{ ep.day }}</span>
            </div>
            {% if ep.status == "next" %}<span class="wb-statusdot next">Register now</span>
            {% elif ep.status == "past" %}<span class="wb-statusdot past">Replay</span>
            {% else %}<span class="tag">{{ ep.tag }}</span>{% endif %}
          </div>
          <h3>{{ ep.title }}</h3>
          <p>{{ ep.blurb }}</p>
          <div class="act">
            {% if ep.status == "next" %}
              <a href="{{ ep.registerUrl }}" class="wb-link register" data-cta="series-{{ ep.slug }}">Reserve your seat →</a>
            {% elif ep.status == "past" and ep.replayUrl %}
              <a href="{{ ep.replayUrl }}" class="wb-link replay" data-cta="series-{{ ep.slug }}">▶ Watch the replay</a>
            {% elif ep.status == "past" %}
              <span class="wb-soon">Replay coming soon</span>
            {% else %}
              <span class="wb-soon">{{ ep.dateDisplay | replace(", 2026", "") }} · Registration opens soon</span>
            {% endif %}
          </div>
        </article>
        {% endfor %}
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ===== PAST REPLAYS ===== -->
  <section class="wb-section wb-replays" id="replays">
    <div class="wb-wrap">
      <h2 class="title">Watch past webinars</h2>
      <p class="sub">Missed one? Catch the full recording any time — free, no registration required.</p>
      <div class="wb-replay-grid">
        {% set replayCount = 0 %}
        {% for ep in webinars.episodes %}{% if ep.status == "past" and ep.replayUrl and ep.youtubeId %}
        {% set replayCount = replayCount + 1 %}
        <a class="wb-replay" href="{{ ep.replayUrl }}" data-cta="replay-{{ ep.slug }}">
          <div class="wb-thumb">
            <img src="https://i.ytimg.com/vi/{{ ep.youtubeId }}/hqdefault.jpg" alt="{{ ep.title }} webinar replay" loading="lazy" width="480" height="360">
            <span class="wb-play"><span></span></span>
          </div>
          <div class="meta">
            <span class="tag">{{ ep.tag }} · {{ ep.dateDisplay | replace(", 2026", "") }}</span>
            <h3>{{ ep.title }}</h3>
            <p>{{ ep.blurb }}</p>
            <span class="watch">▶ Watch replay</span>
          </div>
        </a>
        {% endif %}{% endfor %}
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ===== WHAT TO EXPECT ===== -->
  <section class="wb-section">
    <div class="wb-wrap">
      <h2 class="title">What to expect</h2>
      <p class="sub">Real education from someone who has spent 25+ years inside the federal benefits system — not a sales pitch.</p>
      <div class="wb-points">
        <div class="wb-point">
          <div class="ic">🎟️</div>
          <h4>Always free</h4>
          <p>Every session in the series is complimentary.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="wb-point">
          <div class="ic">💻</div>
          <h4>Live on Zoom</h4>
          <p>Join from anywhere. 45–60 minutes plus open Q&amp;A.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="wb-point">
          <div class="ic">🇺🇸</div>
          <h4>We speak federal</h4>
          <p>FERS, TSP, FEHB, FEGLI — taught in plain English.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="wb-point">
          <div class="ic">👥</div>
          <h4>Spouses welcome</h4>
          <p>Attend together, or each register for your own link.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ===== FAQ ===== -->
  <section class="wb-section" style="padding-top:0;">
    <div class="wb-wrap">
      <h2 class="title">Common questions</h2>
      <p class="sub"></p>
      <div class="wb-faq">
        {% for faq in faqSchema %}
        <details{% if loop.first %} open{% endif %}>
          <summary>{{ faq.question }}</summary>
          <p>{{ faq.answer }}</p>
        </details>
        {% endfor %}
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ===== NEWSLETTER ===== -->
  <section class="wb-section" id="newsletter" style="background:var(--cw-gray);">
    <div class="wb-wrap" style="max-width:680px;">
      <h2 class="title">The Federal Benefit Gap newsletter</h2>
      <p class="sub">Plain-English federal retirement insights, legislative updates, and first dibs on webinar seats &mdash; straight to your inbox. Free, and you can unsubscribe anytime.</p>
      <form id="wbNewsForm" novalidate style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:.75rem;max-width:560px;margin:0 auto;">
        <div style="display:flex;gap:.75rem;flex-wrap:wrap;">
          <input type="text" name="first" placeholder="First name" autocomplete="given-name" required style="flex:1;min-width:140px;padding:.85rem 1rem;border:1px solid var(--cw-line);border-radius:8px;font-size:1rem;">
          <input type="text" name="last" placeholder="Last name" autocomplete="family-name" required style="flex:1;min-width:140px;padding:.85rem 1rem;border:1px solid var(--cw-line);border-radius:8px;font-size:1rem;">
        </div>
        <input type="email" name="email" placeholder="Email address" autocomplete="email" required style="padding:.85rem 1rem;border:1px solid var(--cw-line);border-radius:8px;font-size:1rem;">
        <input type="text" name="website" tabindex="-1" autocomplete="off" aria-hidden="true" style="position:absolute;left:-9999px;width:1px;height:1px;">
        <button type="submit" style="padding:.95rem 1.6rem;border:0;border-radius:10px;background:var(--cw-navy);color:#fff;font-weight:700;font-size:1rem;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.03em;cursor:pointer;">Subscribe</button>
        <p id="wbNewsMsg" role="status" aria-live="polite" style="margin:.25rem 0 0;font-size:.9rem;color:var(--cw-slate);"></p>
      </form>
    </div>
  </section>
  <script>
  (function(){
    var f=document.getElementById('wbNewsForm'); if(!f) return;
    var msg=document.getElementById('wbNewsMsg');
    f.addEventListener('submit', async function(e){
      e.preventDefault();
      if(f.website.value){ return; }
      var first=f.first.value.trim(), last=f.last.value.trim(), email=f.email.value.trim();
      if(!first||!email){ msg.textContent='Please enter your name and email.'; msg.style.color='#B31942'; return; }
      var btn=f.querySelector('button'); btn.disabled=true; var orig=btn.textContent; btn.textContent='Subscribing…';
      try{
        var r=await fetch('/api/submit-lead',{method:'POST',headers:{'Content-Type':'application/json'},
          body:JSON.stringify({name:(first+' '+last).trim(),firstName:first,lastName:last,email:email,
            lead_type:'newsletter-signup',lead_source:'Newsletter',submitted_from:'/webinars/'})});
        if(r.ok){ f.innerHTML='<p style="font-size:1.05rem;color:var(--cw-navy);font-weight:600;text-align:center;">You’re in. Check your inbox for a welcome from The Federal Benefit Gap.</p>'; }
        else { var j=await r.json().catch(function(){return{};}); msg.textContent=(j&&j.error)||'Something went wrong — please try again.'; msg.style.color='#B31942'; btn.disabled=false; btn.textContent=orig; }
      }catch(err){ msg.textContent='Network error — please try again.'; msg.style.color='#B31942'; btn.disabled=false; btn.textContent=orig; }
    });
  })();
  </script>

  <!-- ===== SOFT CTA ===== -->
